        <mxCell id="bf08-branches" value="&lt;b&gt;Alternates/exceptions — see matching Section 4 branches and UC contracts&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;BF-08-A1: Pending, refused or partial supplier agreement&lt;br&gt;BF-08-A2: Reuse valid BF-02 decision&lt;br&gt;BF-08-E1: Short pick or supplier custody&lt;br&gt;BF-08-E2: Supplier receipt mismatch&lt;br&gt;BF-08-A3: Replacement or external settlement&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;EX-01–05: role/warehouse, source/version, unknown commit/retry, freeze, evidence/output. Reject/wait/revise preserves the relevant case; never repost automatically." vertex="1" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#24354b;rounded=1;fillColor=#f3f5f8;strokeColor=#d6dde6;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=14;fontSize=13;">
